1. Set AGENT_MODE = false in .cursorrules
2. Show confirmation:
   "✅ AGENT MODE DISABLED
   
   Mode: Interactive (manual approval)
   
   Future patterns will prompt for approval:
   'Detected: [API name] - Implement? [Y/N]'
   
   To re-enable autonomous mode:
   Say 'Enable agent mode'"
   
3. Continue monitoring
4. Prompt before implementing any future patterns
```

