Show status:
"📊 AGENT MODE STATUS
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Current mode: [ON/OFF]

If ON (autonomous):
  • Auto-implements HIGH priority patterns
  • Shows brief notifications only
  • No interruptions during coding
  
If OFF (interactive):
  • Prompts before each implementation
  • You approve each pattern
  • Full control over what gets implemented

To toggle:
  • 'Enable agent mode' → Turn ON
  • 'Disable agent mode' → Turn OFF

Registry: [path to temporal-registry.json]
Implementations: [X] completed
Skipped: [Y] LOW priority items"
```

